<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Smart Sight Glasses</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f7f9fc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    header {
      background: #1a73e8;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .features {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      width: 250px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 10px;
      background: #e0e0e0;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Smart Sight Glasses</h1>
    <p>Empowering the Visually Impaired and Elderly</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <h2>Key Features</h2>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Obstacle Detection</h3>
        <p>Ultrasonic sensors alert users of nearby objects in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Text-to-Speech</h3>
        <p>Reads printed or written text aloud using OCR technology.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Fall Detection</h3>
        <p>Automatically detects falls and sends alerts for help.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2025 Smart Sight Glasses | All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
